# FORGENIQ Vercel deploy safety

## Never

- Run bare `vercel deploy` from `apps/platform` without `--project=forgeniq-platform-staging`.
- Create or link a Vercel project named `platform` (or any name other than `forgeniq-platform-staging` for RI).
- Deploy feature branches to customer www (`www.forgeniq.com` / root `brieftick` project) without explicit user approval.

## Authorised RI staging

- Project: `forgeniq-platform-staging` (`prj_y9O1A1zGFXe3GvJITnLL9mJUqve7`), team `imis-projects-8e15dca0`.
- Preferred path: `node apps/platform/scripts/staging/phase85h-deploy-staging-platform.mjs` from `apps/platform`.
- Run `assert-vercel-staging-target.mjs` before any custom Vercel CLI deploy.

